# Configuration definitions for thorn MCNuX
#
# The binding dependency contract of specs/build-and-integration.md
# [MCNX-BLD-02]: a configuration lacking either capability must fail at
# configure time. MCNuX declares no dependency on any GRMHD or
# spacetime-evolution thorn (GRMHD-agnosticism).

REQUIRES CarpetX
REQUIRES WeakLibInterp
